" :ORIGIN "fiveam")
  (:NAME "DEF-SUITE" :KIND :MACRO :LAMBDA-LIST "(name &key description in)" :DOCSTRING "Define a new test-suite named NAME.

IN (a symbol), if provided, causes this suite te be nested in the
